\" >Upgrade</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Augments </strong>are acquired by doing various things, like harvesting or defeating enemies, when the <strong>data meter fills</strong>. They can also be found from searching crates and other furnishings in ruins and facilities. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >These <strong>upgrades can be swapped or stacked</strong>, and provide <strong>passive abilities</strong> that will be crucial to your survival (similar to other &quot;Hero Builder&quot; type games).</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You'll <strong>choose 1</strong> from a set of 3 or 4 out of over <strong>one</strong>\u00a0<strong>hundred options</strong>.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Defend\u00a0</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Waves</strong> of enemies will swarm you to try to stifle progress. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Over time, and by proceeding to later planets, the <strong>creatures get tougher</strong>, faster, and may use <strong>different attacks</strong>. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are <strong>6 main families</strong>, and several other independent types, to mix things up. The <strong>final boss</strong> of the run will correspond to one of the main creature families on the run's last planet.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3737170/extras/6a0ffa948913eed274293d6f210fac89.poster.avif?t=1767572407\" width=616 height=392 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3737170/extras/6a0ffa948913eed274293d6f210fac89.webm?t=1767572407\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3737170/extras/6a0ffa948913eed274293d6f210fac89.mp4?t=1767572407\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li></ul>